  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The SetBreakpoints goal is designed to set breakpoints in a debugging session. It first checks if debugging is active by evaluating the \\%debugActive\\% variable. If debugging is not active (i.e., \\%debugActive\\% is false), the goal will terminate early without performing any actions. If debugging is active, it proceeds to send a command to set the specified breakpoints, which are provided as an array in the \\%breakpoints\\% variable. The command is structured as a JSON object containing the command type and the breakpoints to be set, and it is sent through the 'debug' channel.",
